Subject: [PATCH 197/212] Lower native BF16 GDN dt bias

---
 src/codegen/nvidia/tensor_ir_codegen.cpp | 39 +++++++++++++++++++-----
 1 file changed, 31 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/codegen/nvidia/tensor_ir_codegen.cpp b/src/codegen/nvidia/tensor_ir_codegen.cpp
index 292167ba2edab3e29de786ff2e47d5d2edb624d8..420cacc7911c24fdf97c585833b66b4e9fe9a783 100644
